      "poly": [
        141.01,
        196.19,
        528.36,
        196.19,
        528.36,
        250.07,
        141.01,
        250.07
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to circulate for the information\nof all Ministries of the Government of India a copy of the minutes\nrecorded by the Prime Minister relating to -",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        166.01,
        265.23,
        487.9,
        265.23,
        487.9,
        307.33,
        166.01,
        307.33
      ],
      "text": "(1) The appointment of Shri R.R.Diwakar, Member of the\n Constituent Assembly, as Minister of State for\n Information and Broadcasting with effect from the\n 7th December, 1948.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        313.22,
        534.31,
        313.22,
        534.31,
        357.01,
        166.6,
        357.01
      ],
      "text": "(2) The appointment of Dr.Balkrishan V.Keskar, Member of the\n Constituent Assembly, as Deputy Minister with effect\n from the 7th December, 1948. He will be attached to\n the Ministry of External Affairs & Commonwealth Relations.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        296.31,
        412.58,
        499.8,
        412.58,
        499.8,
        433.63,
        296.31,
        433.63
      ],
      "text": "(E.C.Donoghue)\nfor Joint Secretary to the Cabinet.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
